          { t: "Meno", y: "c. 385 BCE", lang: "Ancient Greek", sum: "Asks whether virtue can be taught. Introduces the theory of recollection (anamnesis) through an uneducated slave boy who ‘discovers’ geometry, and the difference between knowledge and true belief.", key: "Can virtue be taught?; recollection; knowledge vs true opinion" }
