          { t: "Provincial Letters", y: "1656–1657", lang: "French", sum: "Eighteen satirical letters defending the Jansenist Arnauld and attacking Jesuit casuistry, which allowed loopholes to excuse wrong acts.", key: "Against casuistry; moral laxity" }
